 inherited the situation and we need a resolution. It=E2=80=99s critical to=
 safeguard the future of the base and that matters to us for security reaso=
ns but also clearly to the United States as well.=E2=80=9D</p><p style=3D"m=
argin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p><p style=3D"marg=
